BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20230622T091600Z
DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nFrom Insights to Action: Exploring the Impact of Gene
	rative AI on Work\, Learning\, and Society\nSynopsis\n:\nIn this session\,
	 Soumee De\, Partner from EY Workforce Advisory will explore the transform
	ative power of emerging skills in the financial sector that impacts work\,
	 learning and society. In this session she will share insights and end wit
	h a call to action at individual and team level. Agenda includes: \n•   
	        Impact of megatrends on reshaping the future of work\, learning an
	d society\n•           EY case study of how a wealth manager integrated 
	OpenAI  technology to enable the Financial Advisors\n•           EY case
	 study on democratising learning by offering virtual Tech MBA / Masters in
	 Sustainability\n•           Practical next steps on how to navigate to 
	future forward as an individual and collective team\nSpeaker\n:\nSoumee DE
	\, Partner\, People Advisory Services EY Singapore\nJoining Instructions\n
	(via Webex)\n \nJoin via Laptop\n*As a first time participant using DBS la
	ptop\, you must follow this  One Time Webex Setup using DBS Laptop.mp4 <ht
	tps://dbs1bank-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/personal/jamesongck_dbs_com/EVcKkn_
	W6DlCq6ZBNJZMd10Bd_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzBDh2>  guide prior to the even
	t. This will install Webex Meeting App from DBS Software Centre for optima
	l streaming experience!\n1.	On the day of the event\, click on this hyperl
	ink: Webex Events URL <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/onstage/g.php?MTID=e77165
	64ccfe56b67dbb7054a6f359fb0> \n2.	Enter your First Name\, Last Name\, Emai
	l Address and click on [Join Now]\n \n \nJoin via Mobile Device\n1.	Downlo
	ad Webex Meetings App from Apple App Store or Google PlayStore\nClick on J
	oin Meeting & Input Meeting Number: 2510 686 5933\n2.	Input Password 1234\
	n \n \nJoin via Phone (audio only)\nDial:  +65-3157-6442 (Singapore)\nDial
	:  +852-3018-6828 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22-6480-0114 (India-Mumbai)\nDia
	l:  +91-40-6480-0114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeeting Number:  2510 686 5933\nGl
	obal call-in numbers <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID=e8b3
	48588cbf111d8933d1b2e9c4a554e> \n \n \n \n \n
